"Researchers of the Distal Expansion made Davrar's mortals as true sapient beings."
"The Questor seer Ushia calls mortals figments of Davrar itself."
"Mortality was built into Davrar's founding, and no council can change it."
"Never before have creations of Davrar beaten Questors over the long span."
"The Endings were meant to stress-test mortal cultures and keep their numbers down."
"Later, a Questor Conclave argues over whether mortals could ever become Questors."
"Years later, mortals can progress toward Questorhood by completing Quests."
"Nine years later, the Heirs call themselves half-mortals."
